license: MIT
version: 0.2.0-alpha18
date-released: 2026-07-30
abstract: >-
  Cross-platform Umamusume Pretty Derby mod manager and mod-development
  workspace, forked from UMML / UmaMusume Mod Loader. It provides immutable
  package versions, automatic preparation, profiles, compatibility metadata,
  creator workspaces, transactional deployment, recovery, and read-only data
  integrations.
